WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.210
OK, we have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.270
That number is two one nine two David P..

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.750
A very good question here from someone thinking
ahead about voting in November.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.240
Take a listen.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.240
David.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.240
Joe from California.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.240
Yeah.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.869
Hey, I've been seeing online people are suggesting
that they take their mail in ballot, their

00:00:19.869 --> 00:00:22.760
absentee ballot to the polling place and dropping
it off.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.760
Right.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.789
Therefore, not having to put it on the post
office to have to mail and send it in.

00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:30.789
Yep.

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:31.789
What do you think?

00:00:31.789 --> 00:00:32.789
Good idea.

00:00:32.789 --> 00:00:33.789
I think so.

00:00:33.789 --> 00:00:34.789
I don't.

00:00:34.789 --> 00:00:35.789
Yeah.

00:00:35.789 --> 00:00:36.789
So.

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:38.750
So listen, the answer is it's probably a good
idea to go and drop off your ballot if you're

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:39.750
able to.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.790
But what you have to understand is the post
office is a public service.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.840
And there's a lot of people in this country
who don't have vehicles and can't easily get

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:51.420
to city hall or wherever you can drop off
your ballot.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.870
There are people who live in really rural
areas.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.110
So even if they have a car, they'd have to
take half a day off from work to go and drop

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:59.030
off their ballot, et cetera, et cetera.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:04.309
So it really shouldn't depend on people going
and dropping off their ballot at City Hall

00:01:04.309 --> 00:01:05.440
in person.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.259
I plan to do it because Boston is small and
I can do it right.

00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:15.130
I'll just find 20 minutes and I'll go over
and I will drop it off depending on where

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.130
you live.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.950
You may be better off just mailing the ballot
early.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:24.289
So, yes, it is a good idea to go and drop
off the ballot in person depending on your

00:01:24.289 --> 00:01:27.450
circumstances where you have to drop it off.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:31.719
How much you trust the mail system, where
you are and how early you're able to send

00:01:31.719 --> 00:01:32.719
your ballot.

00:01:32.719 --> 00:01:34.799
But certainly something people should consider.

